text-align:center\"\u003e\\[\\\\\\[Recommended to use with the BetterRTX mod\\\\\\]\\](\u003ca href=\"https://discord.gg/minecraft-rtx-691547840463241267\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003ehttps://discord.gg/minecraft-rtx-691547840463241267\u003c/a\u003e)\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eTrailers\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eJava Edition:\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0QiNSQ7EFxg\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eBedrock Edition:\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YPIT-5k1ffY?t\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhat's New\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOptimum Realism's Bedrock pipeline has been completely rebuilt. Every block is now processed through a custom-built automation tool that converts the full Java pack to Bedrock RTX format with consistent PBR quality across the board.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFull 1.21.5 support\u003c/strong\u003e \u0026mdash; copper, pale garden, resin, eyeblossoms, and every new block\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVibrant Visuals compatible\u003c/strong\u003e \u0026mdash; works with Minecraft's new PBR graphics on Xbox, PlayStation, mobile, and PC\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRTX and deferred shader support\u003c/strong\u003e \u0026mdash; full PBR pipeline with BetterRTX, YSS SE, and other deferred shaders\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAutomated quality\u003c/strong\u003e \u0026mdash; every block gets the same PBR treatment, no manual conversion gaps\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eIs it free?\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eYes, partially. The 64x version of Optimum Realism is free. Higher resolutions (128x, 256x ) are member-exclusive.\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBecome a member from either of the following:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.patreon.com/posts/optimum-realism-101575011\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/973113/description_106ec98c-a250-4305-a4fe-87d03bd41f20.png\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstore.optimumrealism.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/973113/description_f359c660-696c-4eda-a3c3-7f821307461d.png\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSystem Requirements\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/973113/description_efbec85a-8737-43f8-a117-222d9f2feb29.png\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eRTX (BetterRTX mod):\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eJust an RTX graphics card is required to run this texture pack smoothly.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eDeferred shaders on PC:\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA GTX 1050 is recommended but not required. Performance depends on your world type and shader settings.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eDeferred shaders on mobile:\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA mid-range device is recommended. \u003ca href=\"https://discord.gg/yss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003eYSS SE Shaders\u003c/a\u003e is the recommended deferred shader for mobile. Performance may vary by device.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eVibrant Visuals:\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWorks on any device that supports Minecraft's Vibrant Visuals mode \u0026mdash; Xbox Series X|S, Xbox One, PlayStation 4/5, Android, iOS, and PC. No additional mods needed.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/973113/description_be2fdf66-7a3c-47a9-8432-4e9f18e71a55.png\" alt=\"\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e690+ PBR materials processed through an automated pipeline\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUpdated for Minecraft 1.21.5 with full block coverage\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVibrant Visuals, RTX, and deferred shader compatible\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRuns on PC, console, and mobile with PBR\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e3M+ downloads across all platforms\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAn exemplary balance between quality and performance\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003ePhysically Based Rendering with the following maps:\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eColour\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNormal\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeight (Displacement)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEmissive\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMetallic\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRoughness\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpacity\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"16:[\"$\",\"$L54\",null,{\"game\":{\"id\":78022,\"slug\":\"minecraft-bedrock\",\"name\":\"Minecraft Bedrock\",\"downloadsCount\":479955190,\"createdAt\":1627304015587,\"modsCount\":15281,\"logoUrl\":\"https://media.forgecdn.net/game-logos/78022_53d91979-714a-4ade-a939-c935896c6456.png\",\"tileUrl\":\"https://media.forgecdn.net/game-box-art/78022_9a53743e-4327-4532-ae9d-298208adacb6.jpg\",\"iconUrl\":\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/652/316/638053973637065420.png\"},\"project\":{\"id\":973113,\"gameId\":78022,\"name\":\"Optimum Realism for Bedrock Edition [Vibrant Visuals Compatible]\",\"slug\":\"optimum-realism-bedrock\",\"author\":{\"id\":102561042,\"name\":\"atmosphere_of_tech\",\"isEarlyAccessAuthor\":false,\"userTierInfo\":{\"level\":\"None\",\"threshold\":null}},\"members\":[{\"id\":102561042,\"name\":\"at